              "text": "Rhodes Island will be there to see the light of dawn."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Maybe I didn't want to show you the crueler side of things.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "text": "Maybe you're right. The cruelty behind the happiness, the joy behind the suffering. We've experienced it all ourselves."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "text": "I'll admit, I shared these wondrous stories with Theresa, and she was just as amazed as I was."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "text": "She always hoped that everyone in Kazdel... no, in all the lands would have the chance to experience such a life. She did her best to see it come true."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "text": "We can't let things slide back, Doctor."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
              "text": "There may come a day that Rhodes Island will be able to see this beauty flourish across the land."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "There's always two sides to life, Amiya.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
