        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "'Deep Dive'."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "The intact data stored within DWDB-221E is decoded by the singularity and exported in a moderated and suitable format as information."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "However, Amiya on her own will not be able to break through the limits of the baseline logic."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...Am I a special case, then?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "I am not certain, but the possibility is there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "But how are we supposed to get close to the information once it's exported?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "Forgive me, Amiya, but I have no further information on this topic."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "I will search through the clues Kal'tsit left behind, and sort anything that may be of use to you so that it is easier to find."
        },
        {
