        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A bridge to the singularity.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "A bridge to knowledge.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Hasn't Kal'tsit already pointed the way for us?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "Has anyone done something like that before?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "There is no precedent in the records."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "...It's worth a try, either way."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "Then you must be aware of the risks. The closer you get to the singularity, the denser the information will become. You may possibly experience it gaining mass."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "Information with mass?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "It is possible here, yes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "It is also possible that information not yet fully decoded will flood into your mind and destroy it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Civilight Eterna",
          "speakerId": "avg_4134_cetsyr_1",
          "text": "And a destroyed mind means..."
        },
